00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:44.220
is actually very human-like,

00:10:44.220 --> 00:10:46.200
oftentimes with hearts of ice.

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:47.400
Some describe the Wendigo

00:10:47.400 --> 00:10:49.620
as having bodies entirely made of ice.

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:51.360
They're gaunt and emaciated,

00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:52.920
so hungry for human flesh

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:54.720
that they've chewed their own lips off.

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:56.340
Whenever a Wendigo would eat another person,

00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:58.980
they would grow in proportion&nbsp;
to what they just consumed

00:10:58.980 --> 00:11:00.600
so they could never truly be full.

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:01.860
It also means that over time,

00:11:01.860 --> 00:11:03.840
Wendigos grow to be gigantic.

00:11:03.840 --> 00:11:06.060
So, how does one become possessed by a Wendigo?

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:07.620
Well, there's actually a few methods.

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:09.480
You could be specifically cursed by a shaman,

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:11.220
you can encounter a Wendigo in your dreams

00:11:11.220 --> 00:11:12.780
where it follows you into the real world,

00:11:12.780 --> 00:11:14.400
or probably the most common method

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:15.240
I've seen floating around

00:11:15.240 --> 00:11:18.180
is that it's punishment for&nbsp;
some sort of dishonorable act,

00:11:18.180 --> 00:11:19.920
breaking a major taboo,

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:22.860
like resorting to cannibalism&nbsp;
during a time of starvation.

00:11:22.860 --> 00:11:25.440
So, what do we know about&nbsp;
exercising a Wendigo spirit?

00:11:25.440 --> 00:11:26.400
Well, here's the thing.

00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:28.260
In almost every case I could find,

00:11:28.260 --> 00:11:28.980
you can't.

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:31.980
Once someone becomes possessed&nbsp;
and transformed into a Wendigo,

00:11:31.980 --> 00:11:33.000
there's no coming back.

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:34.620
This isn't a sit down on the couch

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:36.360
and talk about your feelings kind of possession.

00:11:36.360 --> 00:11:37.800
A quick mouth rinse with water

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:39.000
ain't washing this one away.

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:40.860
The solution in the stories that I read

00:11:40.860 --> 00:11:42.360
was to kill the possessed

00:11:42.360 --> 00:11:45.240
so they can't continue their&nbsp;
cannibalistic murder rampage.

00:11:45.240 --> 00:11:46.680
It is that hardcore.

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:49.740
In short, the Wendigo is a&nbsp;
spirit that cannot be exercised,

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:52.680
which, honestly, is pretty darn horrifying.

00:11:52.680 --> 00:11:54.060
Even more horrifying, though,

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:56.700
is that this isn't just something&nbsp;
that exists in folklore.

00:11:56.700 --> 00:11:57.720
It is a real thing.

00:11:57.720 --> 00:11:59.820
There's actually a modern psychiatric condition

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:01.560
that borrows its name from these stories.

00:12:01.560 --> 00:12:03.180
It's called Wendigo Psychosis,

00:12:03.180 --> 00:12:05.880
and it's characterized by an&nbsp;
intense fear of becoming a cannibal

00:12:05.880 --> 00:12:08.580
while suffering from intense&nbsp;
cravings for human flesh.

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:09.480
First off, that right there,

00:12:09.480 --> 00:12:12.300
that could play really well&nbsp;
in some sort of exorcist story

00:12:12.300 --> 00:12:13.320
with the Wendigo spirit.

00:12:13.320 --> 00:12:16.320
Maybe some of the characters are&nbsp;
suffering from this Wendigo psychosis

00:12:16.320 --> 00:12:17.820
without actually being possessed,

00:12:17.820 --> 00:12:20.940
mixing in a bit of mystery as to&nbsp;
who's the one truly in need of help.

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:23.280
But diving even more deeply into the psychosis,

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:26.640
I did find treatments of the&nbsp;
condition in some Kree folklore.

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:29.940
Here, they ate fatty animal&nbsp;
meat and drank animal grease

00:12:29.940 --> 00:12:32.220
in an attempt to drive the&nbsp;
psychosis out of the patient.

00:12:32.220 --> 00:12:33.060
As the stories go,

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:34.440
some of the people who are treated this way

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:37.680
would allegedly vomit up ice&nbsp;
