00:12:37.680 --> 00:12:39.600
Given that the Wendigo, the spirit of winter,

00:12:39.600 --> 00:12:41.280
is supposed to have a heart made of ice,

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:43.080
a pretty easy connection to draw there.

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:46.620
Maybe the curate is literally throwing&nbsp;
up the ice heart of the Wendigo.

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:48.900
So in total, across our spiritual battle,

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:50.580
we have talk about your feelings,

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:51.480
wash your hands,

00:12:51.480 --> 00:12:52.800
throw up a heart made of ice.

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:55.860
I think I know which on that list is going&nbsp;
to be the most difficult to accomplish.

00:12:55.860 --> 00:12:58.860
Wendigo wins the exorcist battle hands down.

